>Gil Bregman (gil@applicom.co.il) wrote:
>: I'm about to port a project of about 200,000 lines of code to Alpha.
>: The system works currently on SunOS 4.1.X, Solaris 2.X, HP-UX, AIX 3.2.5
>: and IRIX 5.X. The system involves a lot of TCP/IP sockets stuff, X and
