In the latest issue of DN&R (Vol 12, #16, 9/11/1995) there is an
article "Winchester disk array hits the accelerator" which had a very
interesting note, which I quote:

	...  The 2100 [5/250] has a console environmental variable
	called PCI_READ_MULT that controlls whether the PCI controller
	cards are to be optimized for the PCI bus or are to operate in
	an "ESIA friendly" manner.  When set "On", PCI read-aheah and
	multiread capabilities are enabled and PCI through put is
	maximized.  But the Alpha 2100 5/250 is shipped from the
