  The floppy-based ECU kit is QA-01YAA-HC, and covers all Alpha platforms.

  When asking potentially low-level questions, it is often helpful if you
  indicate the particular Alpha system, the current or planned version of
  NT (or OpenVMS or UNIX), and if the system needs the ECU on CD-ROM or
