The line drivers for the console terminal are MC1488 (TX) and MC1489 (RX).
They are DEFINITELY not on the TU58 controller. They ARE on the Unibus
Adapter board. L0004 if I remember rightly. Yank the board , look around ,
you can't miss them. 

Also , make sure the keyswitch is in LOCAL position.

Need more help - email me.

Leon Heinkelein



